<title>SPAIN: Spain to cut firms' Social Security costs - press.</title>
<headline>Spain to cut firms' Social Security costs - press.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain plans to cut in half employer contributions to Social Security for two initial years of fixed contracts, according to press reports on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The regulation will be included in the new labour reform law, which the cabinet expects to approve on Friday.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
